  #1201 isolated proposal: M2843 explicitly says potato extract from 200 g boiled
  potato per litre. The component surface boiled potato is a preparation-input shorthand,
  not 200 g/L retained extract solids. The CultureBotHT YAML/current normalized source
  specifies 4 g/L Infusion from Potatoes plus 20 g/L dextrose; the alternate underscore-name
  imported record preserves 4 and 20 without units. Neither record supplies an extraction
  protocol or physical supply-state definition. Neither exact equivalence nor a distinct
  resulting preparation has been established. Withdraw the duplicate new M2843 owner
  and add only a source-bounded preparation/supplied-form note to the existing UNMAPPED0251
  owner. Do not assign CAS93348-51-7, equate the output to whole tissue, promote the
  whole owner, or rewrite its earlier occurrence statistics. Existing-owner supply
  state and preparation lineage are incomplete. M2843 boiling duration, extraction
  method and yield are also unspecified. The supported source preparation can be recorded
  without asserting exact equivalence to the two prior owner occurrences. Raw source
  spellings are retained in case evidence and this source scope; no new globally resolving
  source-local alias is added. Full-owner publication approval and all source-specific
  holds remain pending.'
